an9.44:1.1 | S: “Reverend, they speak of one ‘freed by wisdom’. | T: [Ven. Udāyin:] “‘Released through discernment, released through discernment,’ it is said.
an9.44:1.2 | S: What is the one freed by wisdom that the Buddha spoke of?” | T: To what extent is one described by the Blessed One as released through discernment?”

