an9.62:1.4 | S: Without giving up these nine things you can’t realize perfection. | T: One who hasn’t abandoned these nine things is incapable of realizing arahantship.
an9.62:2.1 | S: After giving up nine things you can realize perfection. | T: “One who has abandoned nine things is capable of realizing arahantship.
